A null spelling lands as an unquoted YAML null in the file; the stderr summary still echoes the raw text retro=null.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
status: draft
sp: 0
---

Body.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md retro=null
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 ---
 status: draft
 sp: 0
+retro: null
 ---
 
 Body.
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: retro=null
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
status: draft
sp: 0
retro: null
---

Body.
-- exit --
0
